The test scenario:

Journey steps:
1. Seek #actions-toggle (the button)
2. Press ArrowDown -> expects aria-expanded="true", focus moves to #action-send (first menu item)
3. Press Escape -> expects aria-expanded="false", focus returns to #actions-toggle

